    ]
]
{pilaf} <boil> ?= all water evaporated

::notes

Rice source: /rice. The source does not specify whether the discarded onion is included in the 500g, the amount of tomato paste, or when to add the listed optional spices other than raisins.
Its wording about boiling oil and meat is retained, not corrected to a different method.

::story

Popular central asian and middle eastern dish. High in nutrition, designed to be prepared and eaten communally.


